WEBVTT

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:31.498
what can we best do to
listen and support them?

00:00:31.542 --> 00:00:32.902
[The Way We Work]

00:00:34.196 --> 00:00:36.195
[Made possible
with the support of Dropbox]

00:00:36.219 --> 00:00:37.426
Hi, my name's Micah.

00:00:37.460 --> 00:00:38.806
But it hasn't always been.

00:00:38.830 --> 00:00:40.799
After a year at my current place of work,

00:00:40.823 --> 00:00:42.934
I started the process
of coming out as trans.

00:00:42.958 --> 00:00:45.054
When I sat down
with human resources to talk

00:00:45.078 --> 00:00:47.916
about how to reintroduce
myself to everybody,

00:00:47.940 --> 00:00:49.566
neither of us had answers.

00:00:49.590 --> 00:00:52.686
Nobody at my place of work
had come out as trans before,

00:00:52.710 --> 00:00:54.566
but that's what I'm here to offer you.

00:00:54.590 --> 00:00:55.865
Three tips on how to talk

00:00:55.889 --> 00:00:58.076
about things that are hard to talk about.

00:00:58.100 --> 00:01:00.918
And for those of you
on the other side of the conversation,